      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUCK SHINES (1) broke from the inside draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 1.5 lengths (22.40) behind CRUSH YOUR RUSH at this track. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Rates highly and will give a great sight. CRUSH YOUR RUSH (8) should enjoy clear running from the outside box. Below best latest at Healesville (16.92) when 6th and beaten 4 lengths. Form here at this distance is strong including two wins. Can do much better this time. CINNABAR ICON (3) missed the frame last time but just three runs back was a strong Grade 5 winner (22.66) at this track over 390m. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. SHIMA LITE (7) was in the money last start and poses a threat again.",
